      "side": 1,
      "message": "If the proposal in https://github.com/gpuweb/gpuweb/issues/3489 is approved then we could also fix this by forcing `TexIndex` here to be flat. There is a debate on whether flat interpolants can always be assumed to be uniform within an invocation unit. As of today, tint doesn\u0027t consider them to be uniform.",
