      "writtenOn": "2022-10-03T17:49:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There\u0027s definitely a benefit if the GPU can avoid actually fetching samples, right?\nIt\u0027s a bigger change, but before landing anything, can we try doing the `sampleGrad` version? dfdx/dfdy ought to be very inexpensive AFAIK, but multiple samples have the potential to cost performance.",
